title: "Few-Step Flow-Matching Error Can Be Misranked by Averaged Jacobian Regularity: A Certified Gaussian Counterexample"
message: "If you use this software or the accompanying manuscript, please cite it as below. The software is MIT-licensed. The manuscript, figures, and compact artifacts are CC BY 4.0."
